# Cline / Roo Code Rules: 清道夫 (Scavenger)
# 将此文件复制到项目根目录的 .clinerules

When executing code modifications:
- ALWAYS check existing implementations in the repository before generating new utilities or components.
- ZERO parallel versions: never introduce `xxx_v2` or duplicate stores.
- CLEAN removals: delete replaced code physically; do not leave commented blocks.
- BASELINE tests: run tests before and after refactoring.
- TOKEN compliance: use project tokens, never hardcode hex colors or arbitrary magic numbers.
